WEBVTT

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:28.520
Well now, you can leave the young lady to me.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:31.350
My sincere thanks.

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:35.040
I'll be coming on the first train in the morning to pick her up.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:36.820
Hurry up, Tome-san!

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.510
Young lady.

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:41.320
It's fine, Nanny.  Go home already.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.560
We'll be going now.

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:48.600
Young lady Shunka, don't forget to wear your belly warmer when you're sleeping!

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:54.260
I don't wear stupid belly warmers.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:57.680
If you've been wearing it since you were a little kid,
you probably can't take it off at this point.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.170
I'm not wearing one!

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:00.550
I'm sorry!

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:05.180
My, my, you two.  You'll tire yourselves out if you start with the horseplay now.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:09.560
Shunka-sama, I'll take care of your belly warmer.  I'll keep it in my bag.

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:18.610
Young lady Shunka.

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.640
To think that she'd be going there herself.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:26.760
Maybe it's because she made a good friend.  And that's not a bad thing.

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:28.500
But there?

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:38.420
All right!  Time for a swim!

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.110
You two there, outta the way!

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.100
You all right?

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.740
All you've been doing is jumping into the water.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.910
Don't just stand there watching me, hop in already!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.750
We'll race.  Come on in!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:12.100
Geez.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.600
Who was that person?

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:36.110
I finally found Ken-niichan, but he's gone off somewhere.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:38.610
Something on your mind, young lady?

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:42.410
You think too much.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.410
Especially since you got back from that trip.

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:47.840
Is that so?

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.460
Tome-san.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:00.410
Come now, young ladies.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:01.970
It's time to head back.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:05.970
What?  Can't we stay a little longer?  It's still so bright out!

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:09.170
It'll be dangerous here once the tide comes in.

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:12.070
Come on, I'll race you to the shore!

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.200
Well, guess we should go too.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.360
Koito-san.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:20.860
Thanks for inviting me.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:24.860
It's been seven years since I've been to this cottage.

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:27.950
I just thought it'd be fun with you here.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:39.840
We're leaving, Mikamo-san.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.060
What's wrong?

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:53.630
That girl just now...

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:55.690
...looked exactly like me.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.190
She's gone.

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:00.680
It was just your imagination.

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:02.710
Guess you're right.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:18.440
Who stopped me at six hands?

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:20.710
Come now.  No one stopped anything.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:23.190
It's really late at night now.

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:26.720
Seriously.  Is she always this much fun?

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.130
She seems a little more so today.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.980
Nuts.  I fell asleep.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.310
What's that?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.120
We left it here, eh?

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.150
It's got dust all over it.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:04.130
Papa, Mama, and me.

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:08.620
I'm sorry.  I haven't forgotten about you.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.020
Who's there?

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:22.120
Tome-san?

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:33.450
A mirror?

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:37.250
Or not.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:45.960
I shouldn't have come here.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.180
I mustn't go upstairs.

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:57.680
But...

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:16.950
Young lady!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.450
Koito-san, it's just a mirror!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.360
I shouldn't have come here.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.700
Young lady, this picture...

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:51.880
Twins?

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:55.740
My sister will never forgive me.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:59.070
Because the one who killed her was me.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:01.750
What do you mean?

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.060
Young lady.

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.520
Tome-san.

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.260
How is Shunka-sama doing?

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.200
She's still in bad shape.

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.240
She hasn't said a word since last night.

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:23.060
I wonder what she's looking at.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.730
My, where's Shunka-sama?

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:34.240
She said she didn't need dinner.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:00.640
It's me.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.540
I see.  Just off the beach here.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:16.650
She bears a grudge against me.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:17.740
Why?

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:21.200
I just watched her die.

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:25.960
I didn't think she was actually drowning at first.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:30.340
By the time I called for the adults, she was already gone.

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.800
It's not your fault.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.490
What more could a five-year-old child have done?

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.850
I've started to believe that too.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.850
That it was an accident.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:46.770
And that I should come here again and say a prayer for my sister.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:50.650
But she won't forgive me!

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.940
I don't believe in ghosts.

00:09:56.830 --> 00:10:01.970
Sometimes you sound so grown-up when you talk that it's downright scary.

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:05.930
It's like there are two different versions of you.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.150
Another...

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:09.210
...me?

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:12.780
I should go sleep in my room.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:14.180
Good night.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.590
Hey, just how far do we have to go?

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:32.560
Look at that girl.

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:40.570
Her swimsuit looks just like yours.  This is her home town.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.900
She comes here to swim every day.

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:47.260
But what about what I saw inside the cottage?

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:52.790
Ever since you decided to come here, you've been suggesting things to yourself.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:56.890
You've been spending every day just thinking about your sister, haven't you?

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:59.360
It's not that simple.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.810
It's pretty hot.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:04.220
Let's go inside.

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:10.790
It's dark.

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.630
Take a deep look.

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:18.940
Let your eyes adjust to the darkness.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:25.950
You were facing me in the bright sunshine outside.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:29.700
A temporary image of me was burnt into your eyes.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.480
It's the same thing.

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:39.240
You saw your reflection in the bright kitchen,
and then went down the corridor, right?

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:41.160
But I heard footsteps too.

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:43.260
Are you sure it wasn't the rustling of the curtains?

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:44.240
But!

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:46.650
There are no such things as ghosts.

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:50.290
Even those who have seen the darkness of this world don't believe in them.

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:52.250
Twenty Faces?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:58.270
Say, would you hold a grudge against her if you had died and she was the one who grew up?

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:02.270
I don't believe in ghosts.

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:07.240
But I know that my late parents are always watching over me.

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:16.800
Where are you going, Koito-san?

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:20.010
I'm gonna buy some sweets.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.210
The ones my sister liked.

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:30.560
Did it go well?

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:33.520
When you say it that way, it sounds like I was deceiving her.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.130
I heard you from over there.

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:41.220
Since I can't really explain all that she saw,

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:43.950
I just picked a reason that'd easily satisfy her.

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:48.790
It's painful to keep thinking about those who've passed away.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:51.380
Even more so when there are bad memories.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:54.560
Oh right, there's this.

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:58.190
It's Shunka's swimsuit.  I had that girl before wear it.

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:01.860
It was tough to convince her to walk around in it.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:05.930
We'd better wash and return it before she notices.

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:11.960
I've been waiting for young lady Shunka to return all this time,

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:14.980
and then I board the train going the opposite direction.

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:21.950
The lemon-flavored ice candy that my sister liked...

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:23.820
I'll eat them with my friend!

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:27.450
Has your sister truly forgiven you?

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:53.390
I'm going to kill Twenty Faces' men one by one.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:57.310
And I'll go kill his surviving supporters one by one.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.980
And I'll keep doing that until Twenty Faces comes out of hiding.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:04.630
She fell!

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:05.090
Watch out!

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:06.660
Get down!

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:12.270
She's vanished.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.360
Young lady!

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:39.040
Are you all right?  Are you hurt anywhere?

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.350
I'm fine.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:44.110
I've told the mistress about that so many times!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.700
She shouldn't put flower pots up there!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:49.530
I'll be sure to tell her more firmly today.

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:56.180
My aunt is getting more and more sloppy in her methods.

00:14:57.030 --> 00:15:00.030
I can't drop my guard when Tome-san's not around.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:02.630
School's the best place for me to relax.

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:05.130
Good morning.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.890
What's the matter?

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.140
You're passing through here, right?

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.640
Move your legs so I can pass.

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:27.720
What happened?

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:41.660
Isn't there some incident that might net me some money?

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:44.430
A visitor?

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.540
Yes, who is it?

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:59.200
Wh-White hair...

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:03.770
You were the one who found the daughter of Twenty Faces, correct?

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:05.190
U-Uhm, well...

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:10.280
Wouldn't it be good if you were able to find your little sister as well?

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:17.280
It was back in the war.  When I came to, she wasn't holding my hand anymore.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:20.520
You deserted her.

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.290
For your own survival.

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:25.420
Everyone has dark places within their heart.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.110
All the more in the hearts of those who lived through the war.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:30.300
But I can get inside of them.

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:33.940
I'm the burning light within your heart.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.560
Yes, be right there!

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:42.870
My, Akine-sama.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.790
You should have come around back.

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.870
You're an accomplice as well.

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:01.660
Welcome home.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:02.740
Thanks.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:11.250
Since I've had staff taking care of this place for so long,

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:14.260
I decided to test out my own skills again.

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.120
The plate seems awfully dark.

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:19.700
I wonder if she put something in that changed the color.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:24.180
My apologies, Aunt.  I know you troubled to make this, but I'm not feeling well.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.690
Oh, what a shame.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:28.770
Please excuse me.

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.980
You mustn't, young lady.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:34.580
Your mother made that food especially for you.

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:37.160
Please at least have a taste.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:45.500
Please excuse me.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.460
O-OK.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:53.300
Young lady.  I'll bring the food to your room.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:58.940
Tome-san's eyes then...

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:01.920
She had the same eyes as that white-haired person.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.480
Why would Tome-san have those?

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.270
Mister...

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:24.070
I sneaked out of my house without my nanny noticing.

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:26.760
I was worried about you.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:29.600
Me, I just happened to be in the neighborhood.

00:18:30.230 --> 00:18:33.380
I see you haven't touched your food.

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:35.340
In that case, you can at least have these.

00:18:40.170 --> 00:18:41.370
Such luxury.

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:44.300
Letting food go to waste.

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:47.620
If only I was able to let my little sister eat her fill back then...

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:50.820
Exactly, young lady.

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:52.880
It's not good to be a picky eater.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:03.240
You were the only one I considered a true friend.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:07.750
This is my first time having fun eating with a friend.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:10.870
Koito-san!  Don't swallow those!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:20.260
A mother feeds a baby who has trouble eating mouth-to-mouth like that.

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:24.140
Ouch!

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:31.340
These were in the mistress' room.

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:34.420
If she keeps taking these she'll eventually die of poison.

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:40.150
She told me that they were nutrients and that I should put them into the young lady's food from time to time.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.700
Young lady!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.120
Please get away!

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.450
Thank you, Tome-san!

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:08.210
Excuse me, where is Uncle Genji?

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:11.390
The master of the house is out of the country right now.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:25.040
I can't let myself become a bother to everyone.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:34.370
But where can I go?

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:47.400
Hey, girlie.  No partying late at night!

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:52.950
They're hunting me down and waiting for Twenty Faces to reappear.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:58.810
But I'll arrive at his door before any of them!
